  "description": "Retention of advertisement signage at fascia level.&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-16725d2a-7fff-b23f-be87-59e27e312c5e&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its design,  internal illumination and architectural features, would have an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;unacceptable impact upon the character and appearance of the subject building, the surrounding streetscene, and is therefore harmful to the visual amenity of the area, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;and would fail to preserve character and appearance of the Broadway Market Conservation Area. As such, the proposal is contrary to policies, LP1, LP3 or LP7 of Hackney&#x27;s Local Plan LP33, and policies D4 and HC1 of the London Plan. Shopfront Design Guide SPG.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
